<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ru">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8"/>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/>
<link rel="icon" href="../favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml"/>
<meta name="description" content="How ASPS Works - Real-time AI protection against scams across calls, messages, emails, and browsing. Protection at the moment of decision."/>
<title>Как это работает - ASPS</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Frank+Ruhl+Libre:wght@400;500;700;800;900&family=Newsreader:ital,opsz,wght@0,16..72,400;0,16..72,500;0,16..72,600;0,16..72,700;1,16..72,400;1,16..72,500&family=Instrument+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Syne:wght@700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/>
<style>
:root {
  --bg-dark: #100E0B;
  --bg-navy: #1A1814;
  --bg-navy-2: #1A1814;
  --bg-navy-3: #1A1814;
  --bg-white: #FFFFFF;
  --bg-light: #F3EFE8;
  --bg-light-2: #E4DDD2;
  --green-600: #8E1A2A;
  --green-500: #BE3A4B;
  --green-400: #BE3A4B;
  --green-dim: rgba(190, 58, 75, 0.12);
  --purple: #7C3AED;
  --purple-dim: rgba(124,58,237,0.12);
  --cyan: #00D4FF;
  --cyan-dim: rgba(0,212,255,0.12);
  --orange: #FF6B35;
  --orange-dim: rgba(255,107,53,0.12);
  --blue: #3B82F6;
  --blue-dim: rgba(59,130,246,0.12);
  --text-white: #FFFFFF;
  --text-light: #E2E8F0;
  --text-muted: #94A3B8;
  --text-dark: #1A1814;
  --text-dark-2: #4A4640;
  --text-dark-3: #6B655C;
  --on-dark-heading: #FFFFFF;
  --on-dark-body: #94A3B8;
  --on-dark-muted: #64748B;
  --on-light-heading: #1A1814;
  --on-light-body: #475569;
  --on-light-muted: #94A3B8;
  --border-dark: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
  --border-dark-2: rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
  --border-light: #E4DDD2;
  --font-body: 'Instrument Sans', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
  --font-display: 'Syne', Georgia, serif;
  --radius-sm: 8px;
  --radius-md: 12px;
  --radius-lg: 16px;
  --radius-xl: 24px;
  --radius-full: 9999px;
  --transition: 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
}

*, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
body {
  font-family: var(--font-body);
  background: var(--bg-white);
  color: var(--text-dark);
  line-height: 1.6;
  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
}
a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
button { font-family: inherit; cursor: pointer; }

.container {
  max-width: 1200px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 0 24px;
}
@media (min-width: 768px) { .container { padding: 0 40px; } }
@media (min-width: 1024px) { .container { padding: 0 60px; } }

/* Navigation */
.nav {
  position: fixed;
  top: 0;
  left: 0;
  right: 0;
  z-index: 1000;
  height: 72px;
  background: rgba(26,24,20,0.97);
  backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-dark);
}
.nav-inner {
  max-width: 1400px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 0 40px;
  height: 100%;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  gap: 32px;
}
.nav-logo { display: flex; align-items: center; }
.nav-links { display: none; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }
@media (min-width: 1024px) { .nav-links { display: flex; } }
.nav-link {
  padding: 8px 16px;
  font-size: 0.875rem;
  font-weight: 500;
  color: var(--text-muted);
  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
  transition: var(--transition);
}
.nav-link:hover { color: var(--text-white); background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); }
.nav-link.active { color: var(--green-400); }
.nav-actions { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }
.nav-btn {
  padding: 10px 20px;
  font-size: 0.875rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
  transition: var(--transition);
  border: none;
}
.nav-btn-ghost {
  background: transparent;
  color: var(--text-muted);
  border: 1px solid var(--border-dark-2);
}
.nav-btn-ghost:hover { color: var(--text-white); border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.25); }
.nav-btn-primary { background: var(--text-white); color: var(--bg-navy); }
.nav-btn-primary:hover { background: var(--bg-light); }

/* Hero */
.hero {
  padding: 160px 0 100px;
  background: linear-gradient(145deg, var(--bg-navy-3) 0%, var(--bg-navy) 60%, #1A1814 100%);
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
}
.hero-glow {
  position: absolute;
  width: 600px;
  height: 600px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  filter: blur(100px);
  pointer-events: none;
}
.hero-glow-1 { top: -200px; right: -100px; background: rgba(190, 58, 75, 0.15); }
.hero-glow-2 { bottom: -200px; left: -100px; background: rgba(124,58,237,0.1); }

.hero-inner {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 2;
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  gap: 60px;
  align-items: center;
}
@media (min-width: 1024px) { .hero-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; } }

.hero-content { text-align: center; }
@media (min-width: 1024px) { .hero-content { text-align: left; } }

.hero-badge {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 10px;
  padding: 8px 16px;
  background: var(--green-dim);
  border: 1px solid rgba(190, 58, 75, 0.25);
  border-radius: var(--radius-full);
  margin-bottom: 28px;
}
.hero-badge-dot {
  width: 8px;
  height: 8px;
  background: var(--green-500);
  border-radius: 50%;
  animation: pulse 2s ease-in-out infinite;
}
@keyframes pulse {
  0%, 100% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1); }
  50% { opacity: 0.7; transform: scale(1.1); }
}
.hero-badge-text {
  font-size: 0.75rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--green-400);
}

.hero-title {
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
  font-weight: 800;
  line-height: 1.1;
  letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  color: var(--text-white);
  margin-bottom: 24px;
}
.hero-title-accent { color: var(--green-400); }

.hero-subtitle {
  font-size: 1.125rem;
  line-height: 1.8;
  color: var(--on-dark-body);
  max-width: 520px;
  margin-bottom: 40px;
}
@media (min-width: 1024px) { .hero-subtitle { margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0; } }
@media (max-width: 1023px) { .hero-subtitle { margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; } }

.hero-cta {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 16px;
  justify-content: center;
}
@media (min-width: 1024px) { .hero-cta { justify-content: flex-start; } }

.btn {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8px;
  padding: 14px 28px;
  font-size: 0.9375rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  border: none;
  transition: var(--transition);
}
.btn-primary { background: var(--text-white); color: var(--bg-navy); }
.btn-primary:hover { background: var(--bg-light); transform: translateY(-2px); }
.btn-secondary {
  background: transparent;
  color: var(--text-muted);
  border: 1.5px solid var(--border-dark-2);
}
.btn-secondary:hover { color: var(--text-white); border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.3); }
.btn-green {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--green-500), var(--green-400));
  color: var(--text-white);
  box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(190, 58, 75, 0.35);
}
.btn-green:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(190, 58, 75, 0.45); }

/* Hero Visual */
.hero-visual {
  display: none;
  justify-content: center;
  align-items: center;
}
@media (min-width: 1024px) { .hero-visual { display: flex; } }

.platform-visual {
  position: relative;
  width: 100%;
  max-width: 500px;
}

.device-frame {
  background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
  border: 1px solid var(--border-dark-2);
  border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
  padding: 20px;
  backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
}

.device-screen {
  background: var(--bg-navy);
  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  padding: 24px;
  min-height: 320px;
}

.alert-demo {
  background: rgba(255,107,53,0.15);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255,107,53,0.3);
  border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  padding: 20px;
  margin-bottom: 16px;
}

.alert-demo-header {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 12px;
  margin-bottom: 12px;
}

.alert-demo-icon {
  width: 36px;
  height: 36px;
  background: var(--orange);
  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  font-size: 1.25rem;
}

.alert-demo-title {
  font-size: 1rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--orange);
}

.alert-demo-text {
  font-size: 0.875rem;
  color: var(--text-light);
  line-height: 1.6;
}

.alert-demo-actions {
  display: flex;
  gap: 12px;
  margin-top: 16px;
}

.alert-btn {
  padding: 10px 20px;
  border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
  font-size: 0.8125rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  border: none;
  cursor: pointer;
}

.alert-btn-danger {
  background: rgba(239,68,68,0.2);
  color: #EF4444;
}

.alert-btn-safe {
  background: var(--green-dim);
  color: var(--green-400);
}

.call-info {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 16px;
  padding: 16px;
  background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
  border-radius: var(--radius-md);
}

.call-avatar {
  width: 48px;
  height: 48px;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--purple-dim), var(--cyan-dim));
  border-radius: 50%;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  font-size: 1.25rem;
}

.call-details h4 {
  font-size: 0.9375rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  color: var(--text-white);
  margin-bottom: 2px;
}

.call-details p {
  font-size: 0.8125rem;
  color: var(--on-dark-body);
}

/* Section Styling */
.section { padding: 100px 0; }
.section-dark { background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--bg-navy) 0%, var(--bg-navy-2) 100%); }
.section-light { background: var(--bg-white); }
.section-gray { background: var(--bg-light); }

.section-header { max-width: 700px; margin-bottom: 60px; }
.section-header.center { text-align: center; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; }

.section-label {
  display: inline-flex;
  padding: 8px 16px;
  background: var(--green-dim);
  border-radius: var(--radius-full);
  font-size: 0.6875rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.12em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--green-500);
  margin-bottom: 20px;
}
.section-label.purple { background: var(--purple-dim); color: var(--purple); }
.section-label.cyan { background: var(--cyan-dim); color: var(--cyan); }
.section-label.orange { background: var(--orange-dim); color: var(--orange); }
.section-label.light { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); color: var(--green-400); }

.section-title {
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3.5vw, 2.5rem);
  font-weight: 800;
  line-height: 1.15;
  letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  color: var(--on-light-heading);
  margin-bottom: 16px;
}
.section-title.light { color: var(--text-white); }

.section-subtitle {
  font-size: 1.0625rem;
  line-height: 1.75;
  color: var(--on-light-body);
}
.section-subtitle.light { color: var(--on-dark-body); }

/* Process Steps */
.process-section {
  padding: 100px 0;
  background: var(--bg-white);
}

.process-steps {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 80px;
}

.process-step {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  gap: 48px;
  align-items: center;
}
@media (min-width: 1024px) {
  .process-step { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
  .process-step:nth-child(even) .step-content { order: 2; }
  .process-step:nth-child(even) .step-visual { order: 1; }
}

.step-content .step-num {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  width: 48px;
  height: 48px;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--green-500), var(--green-400));
  border-radius: 50%;
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-size: 1.25rem;
  font-weight: 800;
  color: var(--text-white);
  margin-bottom: 24px;
}

.step-content h3 {
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-size: 1.75rem;
  font-weight: 800;
  color: var(--on-light-heading);
  margin-bottom: 16px;
}

.step-content p {
  font-size: 1.0625rem;
  color: var(--on-light-body);
  line-height: 1.8;
  margin-bottom: 24px;
}

.step-features {
  list-style: none;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 12px;
}

.step-features li {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 12px;
  font-size: 0.9375rem;
  color: var(--on-light-body);
}

.step-features li::before {
  content: '✓';
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  width: 24px;
  height: 24px;
  background: var(--green-dim);
  border-radius: 50%;
  font-size: 0.75rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--green-500);
}

.step-visual {
  background: var(--bg-light);
  border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
  padding: 40px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  min-height: 300px;
}

.step-visual-icon {
  font-size: 6rem;
}

/* Channels Grid */
.channels-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  gap: 24px;
}
@media (min-width: 768px) { .channels-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); } }
@media (min-width: 1024px) { .channels-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); } }

.channel-card {
  padding: 36px 28px;
  background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
  border: 1px solid var(--border-dark);
  border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
  text-align: center;
  transition: var(--transition);
}
.channel-card:hover {
  background: rgba(190, 58, 75, 0.06);
  border-color: rgba(190, 58, 75, 0.3);
  transform: translateY(-4px);
}

.channel-icon {
  width: 72px;
  height: 72px;
  margin: 0 auto 24px;
  background: var(--green-dim);
  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  font-size: 2rem;
}

.channel-card h3 {
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-size: 1.25rem;
  font-weight: 800;
  color: var(--text-white);
  margin-bottom: 12px;
}

.channel-card p {
  font-size: 0.9375rem;
  color: var(--on-dark-body);
  line-height: 1.7;
}

/* Features Grid */
.features-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  gap: 24px;
}
@media (min-width: 768px) { .features-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); } }
@media (min-width: 1024px) { .features-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); } }

.feature-card {
  padding: 32px 28px;
  background: var(--bg-white);
  border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
  border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  transition: var(--transition);
}
.feature-card:hover {
  border-color: var(--green-500);
  transform: translateY(-4px);
  box-shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
}

.feature-icon {
  width: 52px;
  height: 52px;
  background: var(--bg-light);
  border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  font-size: 1.5rem;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
}

.feature-card h3 {
  font-size: 1.0625rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--on-light-heading);
  margin-bottom: 8px;
}

.feature-card p {
  font-size: 0.9375rem;
  color: var(--on-light-body);
  line-height: 1.7;
}

/* CTA Section */
.cta-section {
  padding: 100px 0;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--bg-navy-3) 0%, var(--bg-navy) 100%);
  text-align: center;
}
.cta-glow {
  position: absolute;
  top: 50%;
  left: 50%;
  transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
  width: 600px;
  height: 400px;
  background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(190, 58, 75, 0.15) 0%, transparent 70%);
  border-radius: 50%;
  pointer-events: none;
}
.cta-inner {
  position: relative;
  z-index: 2;
  max-width: 600px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}
.cta-inner h2 {
  font-family: var(--font-display);
  font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3vw, 2.25rem);
  font-weight: 800;
  color: var(--text-white);
  margin-bottom: 16px;
}
.cta-inner p {
  font-size: 1.0625rem;
  color: var(--on-dark-body);
  line-height: 1.75;
  margin-bottom: 40px;
}
.cta-buttons {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 16px;
}

/* Footer */
.footer {
  padding: 80px 0 40px;
  background: var(--bg-dark);
}
.footer-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  gap: 48px;
  margin-bottom: 64px;
}
@media (min-width: 768px) { .footer-grid { grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr 1fr; } }
.footer-brand p {
  font-size: 0.9375rem;
  color: var(--on-dark-body);
  line-height: 1.75;
  max-width: 320px;
  margin-top: 20px;
}
.footer-col h4 {
  font-size: 0.875rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--text-light);
  margin-bottom: 20px;
}
.footer-col a {
  display: block;
  font-size: 0.9375rem;
  color: var(--on-dark-body);
  margin-bottom: 14px;
  transition: var(--transition);
}
.footer-col a:hover { color: var(--green-400); }
.footer-bottom {
  padding-top: 32px;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--border-dark);
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 16px;
}
.footer-bottom p { font-size: 0.875rem; color: var(--on-dark-muted); }
.footer-links { display: flex; gap: 24px; }
.footer-links a { font-size: 0.875rem; color: var(--on-dark-muted); transition: var(--transition); }
.footer-links a:hover { color: var(--text-light); }
/* Language Dropdown */
.lang-dropdown {
  position: relative;
}
.lang-dropdown-btn {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 6px;
  padding: 8px 12px;
  background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
  border-radius: 8px;
  color: #E2E8F0;
  font-size: 0.8125rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: 0.25s;
}
.lang-dropdown-btn:hover {
  background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
  border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.25);
}
.lang-dropdown-menu {
  position: absolute;
  top: calc(100% + 8px);
  right: 0;
  min-width: 140px;
  padding: 8px 0;
  background: #1A1814;
  border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
  border-radius: 12px;
  box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
  opacity: 0;
  visibility: hidden;
  transform: translateY(-8px);
  transition: 0.25s;
  z-index: 100;
}
.lang-dropdown:hover .lang-dropdown-menu,
.lang-dropdown:focus-within .lang-dropdown-menu {
  opacity: 1;
  visibility: visible;
  transform: translateY(0);
}
.lang-option {
  display: block;
  padding: 10px 16px;
  font-size: 0.875rem;
  color: #94A3B8;
  transition: 0.25s;
  text-decoration: none;
}
.lang-option:hover {
  background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
  color: #FFFFFF;
}
.lang-option.active {
  color: #BE3A4B;
  font-weight: 600;
}

</style>

<style>
/* EDITORIAL THEME OVERRIDE */
:root{--ed-paper:#FAF7F2;--ed-paper-2:#F3EFE8;--ed-ink:#1A1814;--ed-ink-2:#4A4640;--ed-ink-3:#6B655C;--ed-accent:#BE3A4B;--ed-accent-strong:#8E1A2A;--ed-rule:#E4DDD2;--ed-rule-2:#D7CFC2;--ed-serif:'Frank Ruhl Libre','Newsreader',Georgia,serif}
body{background:var(--ed-paper) !important;color:var(--ed-ink)}
h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,.hero-title,.section-title,.page-hero h1{font-family:var(--ed-serif) !important;font-weight:500 !important;letter-spacing:0 !important}
.hero-title,.section-title{letter-spacing:-.01em !important}
.section-eyebrow,.hero-eyebrow,.hero-badge,.stat-label,.step-num,.stat-value,.footer-col h4,.nav-link,.nav-btn,.btn{font-family:'Syne',Georgia,serif !important}
.why-now,.human-section,.pain-cards-grid,.stats,section[class*="warm"]{background:var(--ed-paper-2) !important}
.hero,.partners,.how-it-works,.footer,footer.footer{background-color:var(--ed-ink) !important}
.hero{background-image:linear-gradient(145deg,var(--ed-ink) 0%,#2A2620 60%,var(--ed-ink) 100%) !important}
.partners,.how-it-works{background-image:none !important}
.nav{background:rgba(26,24,20,0.96) !important}
.nav-link.active{color:var(--ed-accent) !important}
.nav-link.active::after{background:var(--ed-accent) !important}
.btn-green,.cf-btn,button[type="submit"].cf-btn{background:var(--ed-accent) !important;background-image:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--ed-accent),var(--ed-accent-strong)) !important;color:#fff !important;box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(190,58,75,0.30) !important}
.hero-badge{background:rgba(190,58,75,0.10) !important;border-color:rgba(190,58,75,0.30) !important}
.hero-badge-dot{background:var(--ed-accent) !important;box-shadow:0 0 12px var(--ed-accent) !important}
.threat-pill-dot.green{background:var(--ed-accent) !important;box-shadow:0 0 8px var(--ed-accent) !important}
.stat-value.green,.stat-value.dark{color:var(--ed-accent) !important}
.hero-stat-value,.hero-title-accent{color:var(--ed-accent) !important}
.pain-card:hover,.intel-card:hover{border-color:var(--ed-accent) !important;box-shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(190,58,75,0.10) !important}
.footer-col a:hover,a:hover{color:var(--ed-accent)}
.origin-body p,.mission-statement,.princ-body,.pullquote-text,.pain-card p,.step-card p,.intel-card p,.human-section p,.epidemic p{font-family:'Newsreader',Georgia,serif}
.cf-input,.cf-textarea,input[type="text"],input[type="email"],textarea,select{background:#FFFFFF !important;border-color:var(--ed-rule-2) !important;color:var(--ed-ink) !important}
.cf-input:focus,.cf-textarea:focus,input:focus,textarea:focus,select:focus{border-color:var(--ed-accent) !important;outline:none !important}
.pain-card,.intel-card,.step-card,.partner-logo{background:#FFFFFF !important;border-color:var(--ed-rule) !important}
.footer a{color:#94A3B8}
.footer a:hover{color:var(--ed-accent)}
section[style*="background:#fff"],section[style*="background:#FFFFFF"],main[style*="background:#fff"]{background:var(--ed-paper) !important}
.page-hero{background:var(--ed-ink) !important}
.contact-info-label,.contact-press strong{color:var(--ed-ink) !important}
.ci-icon{background:rgba(190,58,75,0.10) !important}
.ci-icon svg{stroke:var(--ed-accent) !important}
.contact-press{border-left-color:var(--ed-accent) !important}
.ci-row:hover{color:var(--ed-accent) !important}
html[lang="he"] body{font-family:'Heebo',sans-serif}
.skip-link{background:var(--ed-accent) !important}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- Navigation -->
<nav class="nav">
  <div class="nav-inner">
    <a href="index.html" class="nav-logo">
      <svg width="120" height="32" viewBox="0 0 148 40" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
        <rect x="0" y="0" width="3" height="40" rx="1.5" fill="url(#logoGrad)"/>
        <text x="12" y="27" font-family="'Syne', serif" font-weight="800" font-size="22" fill="#FFFFFF" letter-spacing="-0.5">ASPS</text>
        <circle cx="20" cy="6" r="4" fill="#BE3A4B"/>
        <circle cx="20" cy="6" r="4" fill="#BE3A4B" opacity="0.4">
          <animate attributeName="r" values="4;8;4" dur="2.5s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
          <animate attributeName="opacity" values="0.4;0;0.4" dur="2.5s" repeatCount="indefinite"/>
        </circle>
        <circle cx="20" cy="6" r="2" fill="#FFFFFF"/>
        <defs>
          <linearGradient id="logoGrad" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="40" gradientUnits="userSpaceOnUse">
            <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#BE3A4B"/>
            <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#8E1A2A"/>
          </linearGradient>
        </defs>
      </svg>
    </a>
    
    <div class="nav-links">
      <a href="index.html#epidemic" class="nav-link">Угроза</a>
      <a href="platform.html" class="nav-link active">Как это работает</a>
      <a href="knowledge.html" class="nav-link">База знаний</a>
      <a href="stories.html" class="nav-link">Истории</a>
      <a href="partners.html" class="nav-link">Партнёры</a>
      <a href="about.html" class="nav-link">О нас</a>
    </div>
    
    <div class="nav-actions">
      <div class="lang-dropdown">
        <button class="lang-dropdown-btn" aria-label="Выбрать язык">
          <span class="lang-current">RU</span>
          <svg width="12" height="12" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M3 5l4 4 4-4"/></svg>
        </button>
        <div class="lang-dropdown-menu">
          <a href="../platform.html" class="lang-option">English</a>
          <a href="../he/platform.html" class="lang-option">עברית</a>
          <a href="../fr/platform.html" class="lang-option">Français</a>
          <span class="lang-option active">Русский</span>
          <a href="../es/platform.html" class="lang-option">Español</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <a href="../partner-login.html" class="nav-btn nav-btn-ghost">Вход для партнёров</a>
      <a href="contact.html" class="nav-btn nav-btn-primary">Защититься</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</nav>

<!-- Hero -->
<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-glow hero-glow-1"></div>
  <div class="hero-glow hero-glow-2"></div>
  
  <div class="container">
    <div class="hero-inner">
      <div class="hero-content">
        <div class="hero-badge">
          <span class="hero-badge-dot"></span>
          <span class="hero-badge-text">Real-time protection</span>
        </div>
        
        <h1 class="hero-title">Protection at the <span class="hero-title-accent">moment</span> of decision.</h1>
        <p class="hero-subtitle">ASPS monitors communications in real-time and warns you before you make an irreversible decision. Not after the damage. Before.</p>
        
        <div class="hero-cta">
          <a href="contact.html" class="btn btn-primary">
            Get protected
            <svg width="16" height="16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
          </a>
          <a href="#channels" class="btn btn-secondary">Voir en action</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="hero-visual">
        <div class="platform-visual">
          <div class="device-frame">
            <div class="device-screen">
              <div class="alert-demo">
                <div class="alert-demo-header">
                  <div class="alert-demo-icon">⚠️</div>
                  <div class="alert-demo-title">Potential Scam Detected</div>
                </div>
                <p class="alert-demo-text">This caller is using voice patterns consistent with AI impersonation. The phone number does not match your bank's official numbers.</p>
                <div class="alert-demo-actions">
                  <button class="alert-btn alert-btn-danger">End call</a>
                  <button class="alert-btn alert-btn-safe">Learn more</a>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="call-info">
                <div class="call-avatar">🏦</div>
                <div class="call-details">
                  <h4>Incoming call</h4>
                  <p>Claims: "Your bank security team"</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Channels -->
<section class="section section-dark">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header center">
      <span class="section-label light">Cross-channel protection</span>
      <h2 class="section-title light">Protection everywhere scams happen.</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle light">Scammers attack through multiple channels. ASPS protects you across all of them.</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="channels-grid">
      <div class="channel-card">
        <div class="channel-icon">📞</div>
        <h3>Phone calls</h3>
        <p>Real-time analysis of voice calls to detect AI cloning, impersonation, and social engineering tactics.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="channel-card">
        <div class="channel-icon">💬</div>
        <h3>Text messages</h3>
        <p>Scan SMS and messaging apps for phishing links, urgent scam patterns, and suspicious requests.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="channel-card">
        <div class="channel-icon">📧</div>
        <h3>Emails</h3>
        <p>Identify spoofed senders, malicious attachments, and social engineering in email communications.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="channel-card">
        <div class="channel-icon">🌐</div>
        <h3>Web browsing</h3>
        <p>Detect fake websites, phishing pages, and malicious downloads before you interact with them.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Process Steps -->
<section class="process-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header center">
      <span class="section-label">Как это работает</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">Four steps to real-time protection.</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">From detection to protection in milliseconds — here's how ASPS keeps you safe.</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="process-steps">
      <div class="process-step">
        <div class="step-content">
          <span class="step-num">1</span>
          <h3>Detect</h3>
          <p>ASPS continuously monitors your communications for signs of scam activity. Using AI trained on millions of real scam examples, we identify patterns that humans often miss.</p>
          <ul class="step-features">
            <li>Voice pattern analysis for AI cloning</li>
            <li>Behavioral cues of social engineering</li>
            <li>URL and domain reputation checking</li>
            <li>Sender authentication verification</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="step-visual">
          <span class="step-visual-icon">🔍</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="process-step">
        <div class="step-content">
          <span class="step-num">2</span>
          <h3>Analyze</h3>
          <p>When potential threats are detected, our AI analyzes context, intent, and risk level. We don't just flag keywords — we understand the full picture of what's happening.</p>
          <ul class="step-features">
            <li>Contextual understanding of conversations</li>
            <li>Risk scoring based on multiple factors</li>
            <li>Cross-reference with known scam patterns</li>
            <li>Real-time threat intelligence</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="step-visual">
          <span class="step-visual-icon">🧠</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="process-step">
        <div class="step-content">
          <span class="step-num">3</span>
          <h3>Alert</h3>
          <p>When a scam is detected, you receive an instant, clear warning. We explain exactly why we think something is suspicious, empowering you to make an informed decision.</p>
          <ul class="step-features">
            <li>Instant notifications when threats detected</li>
            <li>Clear explanations of risk factors</li>
            <li>Non-intrusive, actionable warnings</li>
            <li>Customizable alert preferences</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="step-visual">
          <span class="step-visual-icon">⚡</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="process-step">
        <div class="step-content">
          <span class="step-num">4</span>
          <h3>Protect</h3>
          <p>With the right information at the right time, you can make the right decision. ASPS helps you avoid financial loss, emotional harm, and the aftermath of being scammed.</p>
          <ul class="step-features">
            <li>One-tap actions to end suspicious calls</li>
            <li>Safe verification options</li>
            <li>Incident reporting and documentation</li>
            <li>Ongoing protection and learning</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="step-visual">
          <span class="step-visual-icon">🛡️</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Features -->
<section class="section section-gray">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header center">
      <span class="section-label purple">Capabilities</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">Built for the age of AI scams.</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">As scams become more sophisticated, so does our protection.</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="features-grid">
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">🎭</div>
        <h3>AI voice detection</h3>
        <p>Detect AI-generated voice cloning and deepfake audio in real-time during phone calls.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">🔗</div>
        <h3>Link analysis</h3>
        <p>Scan URLs in messages and emails to identify phishing sites and malicious downloads.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">📊</div>
        <h3>Pattern recognition</h3>
        <p>Identify manipulation tactics like urgency, authority claims, and emotional pressure.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">🔐</div>
        <h3>Sender verification</h3>
        <p>Verify caller IDs, email addresses, and message senders against known legitimate sources.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">👨‍👩‍👧‍👦</div>
        <h3>Family protection</h3>
        <p>Extend protection to family members, especially those most vulnerable to scams.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-icon">📱</div>
        <h3>Cross-device sync</h3>
        <p>Seamless protection across your phone, tablet, and computer.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- CTA -->
<section class="cta-section">
  <div class="cta-glow"></div>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="cta-inner">
      <h2>Ready to get protected?</h2>
      <p>Join thousands of people who are already protected by ASPS. Real-time scam prevention starts now.</p>
      <div class="cta-buttons">
        <a href="contact.html" class="btn btn-green">
          Get protected
          <svg width="16" height="16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
        </a>
        <a href="partners.html" class="btn btn-secondary">Partner with us</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Footer -->
<footer class="footer">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="footer-grid">
      <div class="footer-brand">
        <svg width="120" height="32" viewBox="0 0 148 40" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
          <rect x="0" y="0" width="3" height="40" rx="1.5" fill="url(#footerLogoGrad)"/>
          <text x="12" y="27" font-family="'Syne', serif" font-weight="800" font-size="22" fill="#FFFFFF" letter-spacing="-0.5">ASPS</text>
          <circle cx="20" cy="6" r="4" fill="#BE3A4B"/>
          <circle cx="20" cy="6" r="2" fill="#FFFFFF"/>
          <defs>
            <linearGradient id="footerLogoGrad" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="40" gradientUnits="userSpaceOnUse">
              <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#BE3A4B"/>
              <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#8E1A2A"/>
            </linearGradient>
          </defs>
        </svg>
        <p>Защита в реальном времени с помощью ИИ от мошенничества и социальной инженерии. Защищаем людей в критический момент.</p>
      </div>
      
      <div class="footer-col">
        <h4>Платформа</h4>
        <a href="platform.html">Как это работает</a>
        <a href="individuals.html#individuals">Для частных лиц</a>
        <a href="individuals.html#families">Для семей</a>
        <a href="partners.html">Для партнёров</a>
      </div>
      
      <div class="footer-col">
        <h4>Ресурсы</h4>
        <a href="knowledge.html">База знаний</a>
        <a href="knowledge.html">Аналитика мошенничества</a>
        <a href="stories.html#support">Получить помощь</a>
        <a href="stories.html">Истории</a>
      </div>
      
      <div class="footer-col">
        <h4>Компания</h4>
        <a href="about.html">О нас</a>
        <a href="about.html#mission">Наша миссия</a>
        <a href="about.html#ethics">Этика и доверие</a>
        <a href="contact.html">Контакт</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="footer-bottom">
      <p>© 2026 ASPS. Все права защищены.</p>
      <div class="footer-links">
        <a href="privacy.html">Конфиденциальность</a>
        <a href="privacy.html#terms">Условия</a>
        <a href="privacy.html#cookies">Куки</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<script src="../cookie-banner.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
